    "body": "We already diverged from GB18030-2022 spec because of the non-round trip mapping [proposed by UTC](https://www.unicode.org/L2/L2023/23003r-gb18030-recommendations.pdf). There is no point in changing 0xA3 0xA0 mapping from the spec conformance perspective.",
